          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使うものを選ぶだけ。中身はあとから自由に変えられます。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Just choose the apps you use. You can change any button later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使わない" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Off"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "例: ⌘L → ⌘C。スクリーンショットの ⇧⌘4 など、macOS が先に使うキーは記録できないので、ここに入力します" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For example, ⌘L → ⌘C. Type keys that macOS uses first here, like ⇧⌘4 for screenshots, because they can't be recorded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
